  "notes": [
    "Hunters keep moving during short attack wind-ups, commit to a physical forward strike and recover quickly. A brief directional hit window replaces the old stationary animation delay; real cover still blocks hits.",
    "Predictable close circling is harder to sustain. Hunters can lead visible movement during early wind-up, then commit without late homing. Overlapping multiplayer targets trigger a physical spacing correction before a normal attack.",
    "Moving chainsaw attacks retain animated legs and their two-handed grip. Blackwater claws now reach their striking pose at the actual hit window, with three distinct gestures.",
    "Blackwater uses darker, narrower maintenance-light pools and a calmer safe room with one printed briefing/map station. Pipes, grime, haze and the recent locker entry/exit animation are retained.",
    "The detailed Blackwater replacement creature remains a separate Blender review candidate. This release improves existing hunter behavior and animation; it does not silently replace the model awaiting review.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
